OL,3,GNEWSAPM challenged to song battle by
OL,4,Ahealth campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has been
OL,7,Fchallenged to a "rock battle" by a
OL,8,Fhealth campaigner.
OL,10,FAshleigh Harley was diagnosed with
OL,11,FEhlers-Danlos syndrome (EDS) in 2020,
OL,12,Fwhich causes her joints to dislocate
OL,13,Fwithout warning.
OL,15,FThe 27-year-old believes she has lived
OL,16,Fwith the condition since she was 12 and
OL,17,Fsaid her health became so bad that she
OL,18,Fneeded life support after becoming
OL,19,Funable to eat, walk or speak.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
